        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/0fcc45f78a3c2e1393c7e6784c60451c.poster.avif?t=1788480546\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/0fcc45f78a3c2e1393c7e6784c60451c.webm?t=1788480546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/0fcc45f78a3c2e1393c7e6784c60451c.mp4?t=1788480546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Crystal Conquest is a <strong>Free-To-Play</strong> VR game where you <strong>control the elements</strong> and battle for victory. Imagine the elemental magic of Avatar in VR across fighting, MOBA, and level based campaign modes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/35ea44e2f6f728a6d39a3b88cac92d84.avif?t=1788480546\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras_big/35ea44e2f6f728a6d39a3b88cac92d84.avif?t=1788480546 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>SUPPORT US ON KICKSTARTER HERE: </u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're having a small kickstarter to get our game to have faster development time and open up the scale of the game bigger! Our game will continue to be updated regardless of a succesful Kickstarter fund or not!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Cross-play with Quest and PSVR2 players is supported!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as elemental mages - 4 available by default, unlock more over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which spells to take into battle, unlock more over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your in-match shop - choose your potions, wands and other items, unlock more over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different modes to suit your mood: Duel (1v1), Conquest MOBA (3v3) or Gauntlet (players vs waves of enemies)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player or Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Private lobbies available, bring your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills-based matchmaking to pair you with equal opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the game's future by communicating with the Studio on Discord </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/fb16b1bc2e8d96d03c76ea8e98ffb12b.poster.avif?t=1788480546\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/fb16b1bc2e8d96d03c76ea8e98ffb12b.webm?t=1788480546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your mage: </strong>Choose the class that matches your playstyle and elements. Unlock class variants as you grow and customize your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/552b9c776a10d629b3adb9153b40c3af.poster.avif?t=1788480546\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/552b9c776a10d629b3adb9153b40c3af.webm?t=1788480546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/552b9c776a10d629b3adb9153b40c3af.mp4?t=1788480546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><br><strong>Harness the elements: </strong>Battle with elemental magic where each element has unique properties. Use earth, fire, water, and wind to block, dodge, and deflect your enemy's attacks.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/aa825b9ab8ee1e4162fd5a287efa5922.poster.avif?t=1788480546\" width=394 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/aa825b9ab8ee1e4162fd5a287efa5922.webm?t=1788480546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/aa825b9ab8ee1e4162fd5a287efa5922.mp4?t=1788480546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow in Power: </strong>Level up and unlock even more epic spells that change how you control the elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/c80de02fc85414e0fe18cc825adb314c.poster.avif?t=1788480546\" width=396 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/c80de02fc85414e0fe18cc825adb314c.webm?t=1788480546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/c80de02fc85414e0fe18cc825adb314c.mp4?t=1788480546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>Choose Your Battle Mode: </strong>Battle in 3v3 matches to capture crystals and topple towers, face off in duels, or team up in co-op to take on waves of AI. All modes support AI for solo or practice play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/0fcc45f78a3c2e1393c7e6784c60451c.poster.avif?t=1788480546\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/0fcc45f78a3c2e1393c7e6784c60451c.webm?t=1788480546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/0fcc45f78a3c2e1393c7e6784c60451c.mp4?t=1788480546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Crystal Conquest is a <strong>Free-To-Play</strong> VR game where you <strong>control the elements</strong> and battle for victory. Imagine the elemental magic of Avatar in VR across fighting, MOBA, and level based campaign modes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/35ea44e2f6f728a6d39a3b88cac92d84.avif?t=1788480546\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras_big/35ea44e2f6f728a6d39a3b88cac92d84.avif?t=1788480546 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>SUPPORT US ON KICKSTARTER HERE: </u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're having a small kickstarter to get our game to have faster development time and open up the scale of the game bigger! Our game will continue to be updated regardless of a succesful Kickstarter fund or not!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Cross-play with Quest and PSVR2 players is supported!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as elemental mages - 4 available by default, unlock more over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which spells to take into battle, unlock more over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your in-match shop - choose your potions, wands and other items, unlock more over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different modes to suit your mood: Duel (1v1), Conquest MOBA (3v3) or Gauntlet (players vs waves of enemies)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player or Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Private lobbies available, bring your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills-based matchmaking to pair you with equal opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the game's future by communicating with the Studio on Discord </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/fb16b1bc2e8d96d03c76ea8e98ffb12b.poster.avif?t=1788480546\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/fb16b1bc2e8d96d03c76ea8e98ffb12b.webm?t=1788480546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your mage: </strong>Choose the class that matches your playstyle and elements. Unlock class variants as you grow and customize your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/552b9c776a10d629b3adb9153b40c3af.poster.avif?t=1788480546\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/552b9c776a10d629b3adb9153b40c3af.webm?t=1788480546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/552b9c776a10d629b3adb9153b40c3af.mp4?t=1788480546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><br><strong>Harness the elements: </strong>Battle with elemental magic where each element has unique properties. Use earth, fire, water, and wind to block, dodge, and deflect your enemy's attacks.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/aa825b9ab8ee1e4162fd5a287efa5922.poster.avif?t=1788480546\" width=394 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/aa825b9ab8ee1e4162fd5a287efa5922.webm?t=1788480546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/aa825b9ab8ee1e4162fd5a287efa5922.mp4?t=1788480546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow in Power: </strong>Level up and unlock even more epic spells that change how you control the elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/c80de02fc85414e0fe18cc825adb314c.poster.avif?t=1788480546\" width=396 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/c80de02fc85414e0fe18cc825adb314c.webm?t=1788480546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/c80de02fc85414e0fe18cc825adb314c.mp4?t=1788480546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>Choose Your Battle Mode: </strong>Battle in 3v3 matches to capture crystals and topple towers, face off in duels, or team up in co-op to take on waves of AI. All modes support AI for solo or practice play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
